{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a weighted fusion strategy for multimodal integration using pca_n2000 (RNA) and resnet50 (image) encoders, replacing the previous concatenation approach. Validation accuracy (0.5232) and F1 (0.5084) are slightly lower than the baseline concat method (0.5266 accuracy, 0.5104 F1), suggesting weighted fusion may not improve performance in this setup. The small performance difference and lack of comparative benchmarks leave uncertainty about the relative effectiveness of fusion strategies with these encoders."
}

